The Court made the following:
'i THE HON'BLE SRI JUSTICE VENKATESWARLU NIMMAGADDA Review I.A.No.1 OF 2023 IN WRIT PETITION NO: 4973/2015 ORDER;
Ch.Chandramma And 3 Others vs The State Of Ap., Revenue Dept., And 4 ... on 7 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/109899625/

This Court passed an order after hearing at length in the writ petition as extracted hereunder;
"Accordingly, writ petition is allowed, directing the respondent Nos.2 to 4 herein to take steps either for payment of compensation on part with other 14 assignees or to hand over demarcated physical possession of the land Ac.1.50 cents each to the petitioners within the same vicinity within a period of six months from the date of receipt of copy of this Order. "
7.
